Blob Storage]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Stores receipt images&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1168BD;strokeColor=#0B4884;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="1110" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sql" value="&lt;b&gt;Claims Database&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Azure SQL Database]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Claims and the tamper-evident audit ledger&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1168BD;strokeColor=#0B4884;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="1110" width="280" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sb" value="&lt;b&gt;Message Queue&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Container: Azure Service Bus]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Claim events and export requests&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#1168BD;strokeColor=#0B4884;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="1110" width="260" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="endpoints" value="&lt;b&gt;API Endpoints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: ASP.NET Core minimal APIs]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Receives HTTP requests, validates input, maps errors to HTTP status codes&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="330" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="auth" value="&lt;b&gt;Auth &amp;amp; Access Policy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: ASP.NET Core policies]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Validates Entra ID tokens; only claimant, line manager, finance and auditor may see a claim&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="560" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claims" value="&lt;b&gt;Claims Workflow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: C# service]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;State machine: Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected, Paid; approve, reject, request info&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="560" width="280" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="export" value="&lt;b&gt;Payroll Export&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: C# service]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Selects approved claims, requests the CSV export, marks claims as exported&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="560" width="260" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="receipts" value="&lt;b&gt;Receipts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: Azure Storage SDK]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Issues 10-minute upload URLs (10 MB, 5 files max), confirms upload and malware scan&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="380" y="820" width="260" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="audit" value="&lt;b&gt;Audit Log&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: SQL ledger table]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Appends who, when, old and new status, and rejection reason for every transition&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="820" width="240" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notify" value="&lt;b&gt;Notifications Publisher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;[Component: Service Bus SDK + outbox]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;Publishes claim.submitted, claim.decided and export.requested events&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#85BBF0;strokeColor=#5D82A8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1340" y="820" width="260" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="Calls REST API with JWT&#xa;[HTTPS/JSON]" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="web" target="endpoints"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="980" y="240" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="980" y="330" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="Checks caller and claim access&#xa;[in-process call]" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#555555;fontSize=10;fontColor=#222222;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="endpoints" target="auth"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="840" y="470" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="660" y="560" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry>